# Codie GEO agent bridge

When invoked as `/codie-geo` or through natural language, read `codie-geo/SKILL.md`, `codie-geo/commands.json`, `codie-geo/orchestrator/SKILL.md` and route accordingly. Full default run means audit, report, planning, fresh research, sourced article, five platform-native posts, QA. Available source architecture: `skills/`, `agents/`, `scripts/`, `schema/`, `templates/`. Optional exact third-party source: `vendor/geo-seo-core` after `bootstrap.py`; don't claim it is preinstalled. Respect approval gates and source attribution.
